raw_text = "~ start
John: Quit [wave]porkin' around[/wave] ba ba haha [wave]snort[/wave]
John: John Pork? I haven't heard that name in years.
John: Pick up the damn phone when im calling.
John: Ok, enough porkin' around, time to get to business
John: Callin' me? That doesn't happen often, just don't call at 3 AM, that's my beauty sleep
John: Ok, so hypothetically, if I was to call you while your [wave]dying grandma[/wave] as saying her last words, would you hang up on her to answer me? Not convinced? What if I had the cure to cancer?
=> END"
